[00:00.97]Maybe I’ll be broken like the bones that carry me,
[00:08.42]Living life so lifelessly,
[00:12.50]Or I could be a good scene in a bad dream,
[00:16.71]I could make it something beautiful,
[00:19.95]And just tare it away from what you don’t believe in.
[00:27.54]You’re dying like this living sideways
[00:30.20](I’ve been living like this all along.)
[02:08.27][00:34.18]I can see that what we have is a problem here,
[02:14.51][00:40.69]and I could be something better if you love me dear.
[02:20.63][00:46.66]Stop, stop with the time you’re wasting
[02:23.93][00:49.93](turn my back and run away)
[02:26.99][00:52.97]I can see that the closest thing to perfect
[02:31.28][00:57.17]is the farthest thing from me.
[02:35.56][01:01.36]
[01:07.70]music.....
[01:32.29]
[01:34.14]Then I could make you love me and just me,
[01:37.72]And everything would be beautiful
[01:41.00]And they could count down the days as we both die.
[01:48.03]
[02:01.64]You can’t stand the sound of silence
[02:04.76](You’re going to live your life alone.)
